     RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We consider antiparallel Wilson lines in N=4 super \
Yang-Mills in the presence\\nof a codimension-1 defect. We compute the Wilson \
lines' expectation value both\\nat weak coupling, in the gauge theory, and at \
strong coupling, by finding the\\nstring configurations which are dual to \
this operator. These configurations\\ndisplay a Gross-Ooguri transition \
between a connected, U-shaped string phase\\nand a phase in which the string \
breaks into two disconnected surfaces. We\\nanalyze in detail the critical \
configurations separating the two phases and\\ncompare the string result with \
the gauge theory one in a certain double scaling\\nlimit.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
