Trancanelli and\\n  Edoardo Vescovi\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"title\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"Deformations of the circular Wilson loop and spectral \
(in)dependence\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"25 pages. v2: minor correction and added (with sincere \
appologies)\\n  missing acknowlegments\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"JHEP 1901 (2019) 076\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"10.1007/JHEP01(2019)076\"\>"}], 
