     RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"  This is a compact review of recent results on \
supersymmetric Wilson loops in\\nABJ(M) and related theories. It aims to be a \
quick introduction to the state of\\nthe art in the field and a discussion of \
open problems. It is divided into\\nshort chapters devoted to different \
questions and techniques. Some new results,\\nperspectives and speculations \
are also presented. We hope this might serve as a\\nbaseline for further \
studies of this topic.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
