      "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We derive the loop equation for the 1-matrix model \
with generic\\ndifference-type measure for eigenvalues and develop a \
recursive algebraic\\nframework for solving it to an arbitrary order in the \
coupling constant in and\\nbeyond the planar approximation. The planar limit \
is solved exactly for a\\none-parametric family of models and in the general \
case at strong coupling. The\\nWilson loop in the N=2* super-Yang-Mills \
theory and the Hoppe model are used to\\nillustrate our methods.\\n\"\>"}], 
     ",", 
