   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\<\"id\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"1112.3816\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"submitter\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Alessandro Vezzani\"\>"}], 
     ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"authors\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"P. Buonsante, R. Burioni, E. Vescovi, and A. \
Vezzani\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"title\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"Quantum Criticality in a Bosonic Josephson \
Junction\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"13 pages, 10 figures\"\>"}], 
     ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"Physical Review A 85, 043625 (2012)\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"10.1103/PhysRevA.85.043625\"\>"}],
      ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"report-no\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"categories\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"cond-mat.stat-mech\"\>"}], 
     ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
      "\[Rule]", "\<\"  In this paper we consider a bosonic Josephson \
junction described by a\\ntwo-mode Bose-Hubbard model, and we thoroughly \
analyze a quantum phase\\ntransition occurring in the system in the limit of \
infinite bosonic population.\\nWe discuss the relation between this quantum \
phase transition and the dynamical\\nbifurcation occurring in the spectrum of \
the Discrete Self Trapping equations\\ndescribing the system at the \
semiclassical level. In particular, we identify\\nfive regimes depending on \
the strength of the effective interaction among\\nbosons, and study the \
finite-size effects arising from the finiteness of the\\nbosonic population. \
We devote a special attention to the critical regime which\\nreduces to the \
dynamical bifurcation point in the thermodynamic limit of\\ninfinite bosonic \
population. Specifically, we highlight an anomalous scaling in\\nthe \
population imbalance between the two wells of the trapping potential, \
as\\nwell as in two quantities borrowed from Quantum Information Theory, i.e. \
the\\nentropy of entanglement and the ground-state fidelity. Our analysis is \
not\\nlimited to the zero temperature case, but considers thermal effects as \
well.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"versions\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
